<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia jobs market seems stronger-Vanstone.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia jobs market seems stronger-Vanstone.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Employment Minister Amanda Vanstone said on Wednesday January labour force data released earlier showed the labour market appears to be gaining strength.</p>
<p>&quot;Overall, the labour market appears to be gathering strength, with trend employment rising and unemployment declining,&quot; Vanstone said in a statement.</p>
</text>
